gaAD(){return"Plots your portfolio's return alongside market benchmarks \u2014 all rebased to 0% at the start of the selected period.\n\n\u2022 Your portfolio line \u2014 the live price history of your owned stocks, each weighted by its value in your display currency at the start of the period\n\u2022 Benchmark lines \u2014 fetched live from Yahoo Finance (e.g. SPY, QQQ, or any ticker you search)\n\u2022 Time range \u2014 switch between 1D, 5D, 1M, 3M, 6M, 1Y, 3Y, 5Y, 10Y\n\nBecause everything starts at 0%, you can directly compare returns regardless of the absolute price level.\n\nNote: the portfolio line is a start-of-period weighted average of your holdings' price moves, not your account's equity curve. A holding with no exchange rate is left out \u2014 the card says which."},
