gaGO(){return"Realized gain/loss as a percentage of what the sold shares cost.\n\nP/L % = Realized P/L \xf7 Total Invested\n\nTotal Invested uses the average cost (AVCO) at the moment of each sell. Dividends are included in Realized P/L. Note: your broker may show a different figure if they use FIFO."},
gaGP(){return"Cost-weighted average holding time across closed positions \u2014 larger positions have more influence.\n\nMeasured from first buy date to last sell date for each stock."},
